      "type": "liability",
      "name_ar": "مكافأة نهاية الخدمة",
      "name_en": "End-of-service benefits provision",
      "postable": true,
      "role": null,
      "monetary": true,
      "note": "Monetary. An end-of-service obligation is measured with actuarial assumptions and is still settled in a determinable number of currency units, which is what IAS 21 asks - unlike the deferred revenue two groups above it, which is settled by delivering goods."
    },
